    "output_key": "entities",
    "description": "Matches corporate names where the name and suffix are connected by hyphens, plus signs, or ampersands without spaces (e.g., 'Kallenbach+Knackmuss Elektro GmbH', 'H\u00f6llerling&Voegtlin Logistik GmbH', 'See-Telekom Gruppe GmbH').",
